  {
    "number": 9,
    "url": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/lets-learn-english-lesson-9-is-it-cold/3261789.html",
    "audio": {
      "url": "https://voa-audio.voanews.eu/vle/2016/04/01/fe67e651-87d0-4b62-9c68-749b2d3c2f21.mp3",
      "sha256": "6b19c02fbf4e0162c9633c1de7387e0068711b3a134485a0b824a6f9e543ca7c",
      "bytes": 975242,
      "durationMs": 121861
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Oh, hi, everyone! Here in Washington, DC, the weather changes often. One day is cold and windy. But the next day is warm and sunny! So, every day I check the forecast. Hello, Phone? What is today’s temperature?",
        "startMs": 1810,
        "endMs": 24820
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "Today it is 18 degrees ...",
        "startMs": 24820,
        "endMs": 27650
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Eighteen degrees! That is cold!",
        "startMs": 27650,
        "endMs": 30590
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "… eighteen degrees Celsius.",
        "startMs": 30590,
        "endMs": 32870
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Oh, Celsius. That is 65 degrees Fahrenheit. That’s warm.",
        "startMs": 33020,
        "endMs": 39250
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "Yes, Anna. It is warm.",
        "startMs": 39250,
        "endMs": 41950
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Excuse me, Phone. Is it windy today?",
        "startMs": 41950,
        "endMs": 45380
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "No, it is not windy today.",
        "startMs": 45990,
        "endMs": 49520
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Is it sunny today?",
        "startMs": 49520,
        "endMs": 51550
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "Yes, Anna. It is sunny.",
        "startMs": 51930,
        "endMs": 55070
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Excuse me, Phone?",
        "startMs": 55230,
        "endMs": 56770
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "Yes, Anna.",
        "startMs": 56840,
        "endMs": 58600
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Is it snowy today?",
        "startMs": 58600,
        "endMs": 60280
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "No, Anna. It is not snowy.",
        "startMs": 60280,
        "endMs": 64570
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Thank you, Phone!",
        "startMs": 65030,
        "endMs": 66920
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Today the weather is warm and sunny -- great for seeing Washington, D.C.",
        "startMs": 66920,
        "endMs": 73080
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Phone! It is not warm and sunny! It is cold and windy and snowy!",
        "startMs": 75130,
        "endMs": 82930
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "Anna, it is not cold, windy, or snowy. It is warm and sunny … in Mexico City, Mexico.",
        "startMs": 83200,
        "endMs": 101080
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Oh. I see. Mexico.",
        "startMs": 101080,
        "endMs": 102250
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Washington weather changes often. Remember to check the forecast -- the right forecast.",
        "startMs": 102250,
        "endMs": 108110
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Phone",
        "english": "Yes, Anna. Next time remember to check the right fore…",
        "startMs": 108110,
        "endMs": 112370
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Okay, thank you Phone. Goodbye, Phone.",
        "startMs": 112370,
        "endMs": 114920
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Until next time!",
        "startMs": 115030,
        "endMs": 117780
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "number": 10,
    "url": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/lets-learn-english-lesson-10/3285228.html",
    "audio": {
      "url": "https://voa-audio.voanews.eu/vle/2016/04/14/442a6a50-693e-411f-8cff-99e40d16614c.mp3",
      "sha256": "0cfd6224bc3b53319acc1b535cc81908f8f9880f8dcee1e0c2a8ff697d5c9a66",
      "bytes": 725721,
      "durationMs": 90671
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Hi! Today, my friend Ashley, is coming over. I am showing her my new apartment! Oh! That’s Ashley calling.",
        "startMs": 1280,
        "endMs": 11390
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Hi Ashley!",
        "startMs": 13250,
        "endMs": 13890
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "Hi Anna! I’m coming to your apartment. Where is your apartment?",
        "startMs": 14150,
        "endMs": 18880
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "My apartment is near the Columbia Heights Metro.",
        "startMs": 18880,
        "endMs": 22660
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "It is near the Columbia Heights Metro?",
        "startMs": 23130,
        "endMs": 25480
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Yes. Exit the Metro and turn right. Then at the bus station turn left. Then walk straight ahead.",
        "startMs": 25600,
        "endMs": 33190
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "Okay. Exit Metro, turn right, turn left, then go straight ahead?",
        "startMs": 33740,
        "endMs": 39260
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Yes. My apartment is near a coffee shop.",
        "startMs": 40210,
        "endMs": 43600
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "Okay. See you soon!",
        "startMs": 43880,
        "endMs": 45410
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Hi, Ashley.",
        "startMs": 48850,
        "endMs": 49930
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "Anna, Which coffee shop? There are three coffee shops.",
        "startMs": 49930,
        "endMs": 54410
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Okay, my apartment is across from a big department store.",
        "startMs": 54760,
        "endMs": 59260
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "A big department store? Ah, I see it!",
        "startMs": 59470,
        "endMs": 63400
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Okay! Bye, Ashley. See you soon!",
        "startMs": 63400,
        "endMs": 65460
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Ashley",
        "english": "Okay. See you soon.",
        "startMs": 66000,
        "endMs": 67470
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Ashley! Ashley! Ashley! Over here! It’s Anna! It’s Anna! Hi!",
        "startMs": 77000,
        "endMs": 82940
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "I love having my friends over. Come on!",
        "startMs": 85720,
        "endMs": 89570
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "number": 11,
    "url": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/lets-learn-english-lesson-11-this-is-my-neighborhood/3293986.html",
    "audio": {
      "url": "https://voa-audio.voanews.eu/vle/2016/04/20/de238e35-97b9-4c21-81e3-e3c26fbeccaa.mp3",
      "sha256": "b22a6f0531dcf943a2b23d5bd09696f2cfc5970f50a3911082b457c532625c6e",
      "bytes": 884445,
      "durationMs": 110524
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Hello! DC is a city for walking. In our neighborhood, I can do all my errands. Marsha, before we get ice cream, I need to return three books to the library. Where is the library?",
        "startMs": 0,
        "endMs": 15950
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "It is on this street on the corner.",
        "startMs": 16400,
        "endMs": 19880
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Awesome!",
        "startMs": 19880,
        "endMs": 20550
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "Let's go!",
        "startMs": 20550,
        "endMs": 20990
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Marsha, I can return the books here.",
        "startMs": 23950,
        "endMs": 26770
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "Anna, what are those in the books?",
        "startMs": 29760,
        "endMs": 32610
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Marsha, these are letters to my family and friends back home … four letters! Is there a post office near here?",
        "startMs": 33710,
        "endMs": 43280
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "Um, no. The post office is far from here. But there is a mailbox across from the store.",
        "startMs": 44490,
        "endMs": 50850
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Awesome! Let’s go!",
        "startMs": 51130,
        "endMs": 52590
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Marsha, now I need to buy stamps.",
        "startMs": 54320,
        "endMs": 56970
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "Do you have cash?",
        "startMs": 56970,
        "endMs": 58320
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "No. Is there a bank near here?",
        "startMs": 58560,
        "endMs": 61240
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "There is a bank behind you.",
        "startMs": 61700,
        "endMs": 63410
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Thanks, Marsha. You know our neighborhood so well.",
        "startMs": 63790,
        "endMs": 67580
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Now I have cash. I can buy stamps.",
        "startMs": 68540,
        "endMs": 71440
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "That store sells stamps.",
        "startMs": 71840,
        "endMs": 74140
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Wait here.",
        "startMs": 74490,
        "endMs": 75400
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "I have stamps.",
        "startMs": 77390,
        "endMs": 78530
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "Wow, you’re fast.",
        "startMs": 78600,
        "endMs": 80330
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Thank you, thank you letters, for sending my words… my love … to my family and friends -",
        "startMs": 81330,
        "endMs": 88910
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha",
        "english": "Do you have more cash?",
        "startMs": 90340,
        "endMs": 91620
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "I do!",
        "startMs": 92310,
        "endMs": 92960
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Marsha & Anna",
        "english": "Ice cream!!",
        "startMs": 95830,
        "endMs": 98460
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "I love my new neighborhood! Everything is near our apartment! Even hair salons, and ice cream!",
        "startMs": 98460,
        "endMs": 107140
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "english": "Until next time!",
        "startMs": 107350,
        "endMs": 108710
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "number": 12,
    "url": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/lets-learn-english-lesson-12-meet-my-family/3301733.html",
    "audio": {
      "url": "https://voa-audio.voanews.eu/vle/2016/04/28/d1527ef7-587d-45b5-b3cc-fecbe37167ab.mp3",
